!                                                                                                   
! This test calculates the CC energy with the X2C Hamiltonian                                       
!                                                                                                   
**DIRAC                                                                                             
.TITLE                                                                                              
Water molecule. X2C Hamiltonian. CC energies.                                                       
.WAVE F                                                                                             
.4INDEX                                                                                             
**HAMILTONIAN                                                                                       
.X2C                                                                                                
**WAVE FUNCTIONS                                                                                    
.SCF                                                                                                
.EXACC                                                                                              
*SCF                                                                                                
.CLOSED SHELL                                                                                       
10                                                                                                  
.OPEN SHELL                                                                                         
1                                                                                                   
1 / 2                                                                                               
.EVCCNV                                                                                             
1.0E-9                                                                                              
**MOLTRA                                                                                            
.ACTIVE                                                                                             
energy -5.0 100 0.01                                                                                
.NO4IND                                                                                             
**EXACC                                                                                             
.OCCUPIED                                                                                           
energy -5.0  0.0  0.01                                                                              
.VIRTUAL                                                                                            
energy  0.0  5.0  0.01                                                                              
.OCC_BETA                                                                                           
energy -5.0 -0.3  0.01                                                                              
.VIR_BETA                                                                                           
energy -0.3  5.0  0.01                                                                              
.PRINT                                                                                              
2                                                                                                   
.MOINT_SCHEME                                                                                       
42                                                                                                  
**INTEGRALS                                                                                         
*READIN                                                                                             
.UNCONTRACT                                                                                         
*END OF                                                                                             


